per game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_anonymous-pro\"><div id=\"header\" class=\"header align_center has_image\"><img alt=\"Siren&#039;s Call: Second Wind\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1MTM3OTc5LnBuZw==/original/2IFBi2.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Siren&#039;s Call: Second Wind</h1></div><div itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Product\" itemscope id=\"view_game_4173978\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a class=\"button buy_btn\" href=\"https://thepensword64.itch.io/sirens-call-second-wind/purchase\">Buy Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span itemprop=\"price\" class=\"dollars\">$10.00 USD</span> <span class=\"sub\">or more</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><strong>Inspired by games like Catherine and early 2000s doujin works,&nbsp;Siren’s Call: Second Wind is a thought-provoking, atmospheric visual novel where the line between dream and reality has shattered completely.</strong><strong><br><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1MTM3Nzg0LmdpZg==/originalm/itAVbj.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></strong><strong></strong><strong><u>Story</u></strong><strong><em><br></em></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><em>The sun shinning over the town of Siren&#x27;s Call, Florida has disappeared. And in its place? A hungry, inexplicable black hole. Every one of us should be dead, but we&#x27;re not. Maybe that&#x27;s why all our friends still came to the wedding.&nbsp;</em></strong><strong><em><br><br></em></strong><strong><em><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1MTM3Nzk2LmdpZg==/originalm/ZFh4P0.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></em></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><em>Well, almost all of them. My best friend, Ruth, is still nowhere to be seen.&nbsp;      </em></strong>            \r\n<strong><em>Something about that feels cruel. Really cruel. Should I follow that cruel feeling or just enjoy this second wind of ours? One thing is for sure, love is in the air. I only hope that air is still safe for us to breathe.</em>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong><u><br><br></u></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><u>The&nbsp;ending&nbsp;of&nbsp;Siren&#x27;s&nbsp;Call: Second Wind is completely dependent on your choices as a player.</u>&nbsp;Whether or not you decide to follow this romantic mood or untie the mystery of the town is entirely up to you.  Just, whatever you do, don&#x27;t get distracted. Couples that split their attention between two loves seldom get the happy ending they want.&nbsp;<br></strong><br>&nbsp;<strong><u>Features<br></u></strong><strong></strong><strong></strong><strong>* A critically acclaimed cast of characters that will stay in your head long after the game’s credits roll.<br></strong><strong></strong><strong>* Around 150,000 words of story with multiple endings completely dependent on your choices.&nbsp;</strong><strong><br></strong><strong></strong><strong>* A gallery of unlockable concept art and CGs with over 70 images.</strong><strong><br></strong><strong>* 50+ music tracks that dynamically change depending on which of your friends is the current center of attention.&nbsp;</strong><strong><br></strong><strong>* A “digression” system that allows you to point out things that the other characters might not have noticed.&nbsp;<br></strong><strong> </strong>     \r\n<strong>* A chance to have the perfect wedding.</strong>    \r\n<strong></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><u>Characters </u></strong>\r\n<br></p>\r\n<figure><strong><em><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1MTM3ODc2LmdpZg==/originalm/aHW%2Fef.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></em></strong><strong></strong><strong><em><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1MTM3ODgwLmdpZg==/originalm/tf%2BY5f.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></em></strong><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1MTM3ODgzLmdpZg==/originalm/1pBBbM.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><strong><em><br></em></strong><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1MTM3ODg4LmdpZg==/originalm/h5p1rO.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><strong><em><br></em></strong><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1MTM3ODk0LmdpZg==/originalm/HUf4tT.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><strong></strong><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1MTM3ODk3LmdpZg==/originalm/C7ZS3P.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1MTM3OTAxLmdpZg==/originalm/fkvWrT.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1MTM3OTExLmdpZg==/originalm/sdqlVn.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><br><em>Content warning</em><br><br><em>Mild fantasy violence, crude humor, terror related to extreme psychological situations, discussion about sexual activities, mild visual depiction of adult characters in lingerie/underwear, discussion about trauma in relation to past sexual activity, discussion of sexual assault/non-consensual sex, discussions of self-harm and/or suicide, and mild use of alcohol.<br><br>All appearing characters are over the age of 22.</em></figure></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" width=\"12\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_1968247\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"02 October 2026 @ 16:41 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 4 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Stat